                                "text": [
                                  "The Borrowed\nHammer",
                                  "Every tool has a\nnumbered outline\nexcept a hammer\nwhose place says",
                                  "WITH ELSA, EAST\nROOF. A return\ndate is crossed\nout and replaced\nwith",
                                  "ASK IF ROOF IS\nSAFE. The depot\ncan tolerate a\nmissing hammer\nbetter",
                                  "than a missing\nneighbor."
